WEBVTT

00:00:01.970 --> 00:00:04.980
<i>All men have a dream.</i>

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:08.610
<i>To go to and from school with a cute girl.</i>

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>Even better if that girl is 
someone you have a crush on.</i>

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:19.830
<i>I never thought I, Kuromine Asahi, 
would see such a day.</i>

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:22.000
<i>But... But I...</i>

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.610
I finally made it!

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:25.830
To this Shangri-La!

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:27.170
Shangri-La?

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:30.800
Oh, you know, I'm just so stoked 
that my dream came true.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.420
And to top it off, we live 
near the same station.

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:35.340
This totally means we're—

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:37.220
Whoa! Shiragami!

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:40.930
Kuromine-kun, what are you going on about?

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:42.450
N-Nothing.

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:43.560
Yeah, nothing.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.410
Well, I don't really get it,

00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:49.440
but I'm happy you live near me, too.

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:51.790
R-Really?

00:00:51.790 --> 00:00:55.910
Well, I never thought I'd 
get to go home this way.

00:00:56.980 --> 00:00:58.240
With a friend, I mean.

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:01.500
<i>Friend?</i>

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:02.790
<i>Friend...</i>

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:04.870
Friends!

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:06.770
Why?!

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:09.280
Why didn't I... Why didn't I...

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:10.340
Kuromine-kun?

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:12.210
<i>Yes,</i>

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:15.730
<i>my crush, Shiragami Youko, and I</i>

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:17.970
<i>have become friends!</i>

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:52.020
<b>I'll Keep This Secret!</b>

00:02:49.610 --> 00:02:51.330
I'll Keep This Secret!

00:02:53.090 --> 00:02:55.520
<i>I never thought things 
would turn out like this.</i>

00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:59.240
<i>I discovered her secret in 
our classroom after school,</i>

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:02.990
<i>just as I was about confess to her.</i>

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:06.330
<i>That she's actually a vampire.</i>

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:09.440
<i>And that if her father finds out I know,</i>

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:12.580
<i>she'll have to leave this school.</i>

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:17.430
<i>I decided to keep it a secret 
in order to protect her, but...</i>

00:03:18.850 --> 00:03:20.720
Is something wrong, Kuromine-kun?

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:22.310
Ah, just...

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:26.190
To be honest, I'm really worried about 
whether or not I can keep your secret...

00:03:26.190 --> 00:03:29.460
Er, wait, no! It's no problem at all!

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:30.560
I'll try really hard!

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:34.690
<i>Crap, I keep blurting out the truth...</i>

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:40.380
You don't have to try that hard.

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:47.440
My school life ended when you 
discovered my secret, anyway.

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:49.890
Yet you became my friend,

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:53.500
and you said you'd help protect my secret.

00:03:53.860 --> 00:03:58.150
So, well... I can't really explain it,

00:03:58.150 --> 00:04:01.670
but I guess what I'm saying is 
that I trust you, Kuromine-kun.

00:04:04.020 --> 00:04:07.040
So you don't have to try so hard.

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:09.720
I'll live with however things turn out.

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:11.980
Oops, my fangs were showing.

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:17.070
Okay! I feel pumped now!

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:18.240
I'll try my best!

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:18.980
Huh?

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:21.610
Were you even listening to me?

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:24.710
Huh? Of course I was.

00:04:24.710 --> 00:04:26.260
Really?

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:32.750
So, how'd it go?

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:34.870
Your confession to Shiragami-san.

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:38.020
Ah, well, how do I put it...

00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:39.680
That's our leaky basket.

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:41.420
You confessed and got rejected, didn't you?

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:42.310
Didn't you?

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:44.390
N-No, it's nothing like that.

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:45.880
Shiragami and I, uh...

00:04:48.630 --> 00:04:50.140
We became friends.

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:51.860
What?

00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:53.220
Friends?

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:00.440
Man, I'm tired.

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:03.450
Sorry for the wait.

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:05.660
Koumoto-sensei, with all due respect,

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:07.450
I must present you with a remonstration.

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:12.770
You arrived in the classroom a minute 
and 34 seconds after class began.

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:14.870
As an instructor, is that acceptable?

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:17.460
Look, I'm sorry, Aizawa.

00:05:17.870 --> 00:05:19.680
You can lecture me later.

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:21.130
Do you really understand?

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:23.960
You're making class start even later.

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:25.860
F-For that, I apologize.

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:27.290
I wasn't thinking.

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:30.350
The class rep is such a stiff.

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:32.260
Y-Yeah, she is.

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:34.310
That's the Iron Lady for you.

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:36.690
Who are you calling "Iron Lady"?

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:38.980
My name is Aizawa Nagisa.

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:44.940
<i>Kuromine Asahi, ever since
I caught sight of you yesterday,</i>

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:46.930
<i>something's been bothering me.</i>

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:50.340
<i>It was last summer...</i>

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:53.890
Kuromine Asahi, I'll get right to the point.

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:57.960
If you wouldn't mind, I'd like 
you to stop staring at me.

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:00.420
I'm completely uninterested in you.

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:01.750
<b>Completely Uninterested</b>

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:07.530
It's irrational of you to continue pursuing 
a battle you have no chance of winning.

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:05.380
<b>Irrational</b>

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:06.510
<b>No chance</b>

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:11.140
But failure in a reckless battle 
opens the path to a good battle.

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:08.720
<b>A new path</b>

00:06:11.650 --> 00:06:14.320
You ought to begin looking 
for a new path immediately.

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:18.610
Hang in there, Asahi!

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:20.100
The wounds aren't that deep!

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:21.610
Are you okay?

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:25.110
<i>Some time passed after that,</i>

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:29.510
<i>and Kuromine Asahi seemed to 
have discovered a new path.</i>

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:34.410
<i>He must have taken my advice.</i>

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:36.810
<i>That makes me happy.</i>

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:40.000
<i>That's fine.</i>

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:42.000
<i>That's fine, but...</i>

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:45.230
<i>Something is still bothering me.</i>

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:50.130
<i>The class rep's glaring daggers at me!</i>

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:52.850
<i>No, I must be calm.</i>

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:56.750
<i>I know, Kuromine Asahi, 
this isn't your fault.</i>

00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:59.940
<i>But I feel the need to at least lecture you.</i>

00:07:00.530 --> 00:07:06.530
<i>To ask you: were you really attracted to me?</i>

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:08.530
<i>Really?</i>

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:10.480
<i>Come to think of it,</i>

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:13.290
<i>I rejected him before he could 
convey his message to me.</i>

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:18.020
<i>But if I was mistaken about 
him having feelings for me...</i>

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:21.980
<i>There's no mistake that he was looking at me.</i>

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:24.690
<i>If it's not because he 
was attracted, then why?</i>

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:26.660
<i>What was he looking at?</i>

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:29.010
<i>Surely not...</i>

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:31.930
Kuromine Asahi!

00:07:35.490 --> 00:07:37.510
C-Class Rep...

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:40.350
Sorry, this is about what 
happened in class, isn't it?

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:42.020
I'll be more focused from now on.

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:43.720
I don't care about that.

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:46.400
It's about last summer.

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:48.230
Tell me the truth about what happened.

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:50.920
Huh? The truth? About what?

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:52.910
Enough! Just tell me clearly!

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:59.040
I mean... about... you know... 
were you really, well, um...

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:01.160
You're not being very clear yourself.

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:03.540
No, I mean, in other words,

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:06.650
I'm asking you if you really liked me!

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:07.890
Huh?

00:08:09.850 --> 00:08:10.710
Uh, yes...

00:08:10.980 --> 00:08:12.380
R-Really?

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:19.390
<i>What am I doing, asking such a thing?!</i>

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:21.440
What's going on? Lovers' quarrel?

00:08:21.440 --> 00:08:23.940
I thought the class rep rejected Asahi.

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:26.020
But isn't she making a move on <i>him</i>?

00:08:26.570 --> 00:08:27.280
No!

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:28.230
Absolutely not!

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:30.980
I hate men like him!

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:35.330
Who would love a man who goes straight 
to another girl right after being rejected?!

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:38.490
I-I'm sorry.

00:08:40.670 --> 00:08:42.500
Give him a break, Class Rep!

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:44.070
Asahi's going through a lot now.

00:08:44.070 --> 00:08:45.390
Yes, yes.

00:08:45.390 --> 00:08:46.800
Give him some space.

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:48.340
He got friend zoned.

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:49.250
N-No!

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:53.090
Oh... She hates me that much, huh?

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:55.980
That's not it.

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:57.430
That's not it!

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:03.780
One, two, three, four...

00:09:03.780 --> 00:09:07.270
Everyone else is gone, right, Kuromine-kun?

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:09.400
Yeah, Shiragami.

00:09:09.810 --> 00:09:13.400
Now we don't have to worry 
about anyone seeing.

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:16.210
No one will interfere.

00:09:16.850 --> 00:09:18.160
Finally...

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:21.580
Finally, I can have lunch!

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:25.300
Oh, so you've been eating lunch after school?

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:27.080
I can't let people see my fangs.

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:33.820
Wait, was it your stomach that 
was growling all afternoon?

00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:35.410
K-Kuromine-kun!

00:09:35.410 --> 00:09:36.790
Sorry.

00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:40.380
A-Anyway!

00:09:40.380 --> 00:09:42.210
Time to eat!

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.080
Is something wrong, Kuromine-kun?

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:51.890
Why are you staring at my lunch?

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:53.570
You can't have any!

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:55.530
Not even you, Kuromine-kun!

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:56.890
Not my last shrimp!

00:09:56.890 --> 00:09:59.230
No, that's not it.

00:10:00.230 --> 00:10:06.670
I thought since you're a vampire, 
you'd be sucking blood for lunch.

00:10:06.670 --> 00:10:07.860
I guess not.

00:10:08.570 --> 00:10:12.290
Kuromine-kun, that's sexual harassment.

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:13.860
Huh? Why?!

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:16.550
Sucking blood? As a meal, no less?

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:18.840
I'm not a slut!

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:22.490
I'm not sure I get it, but sorry.

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:24.850
No, I'm sorry, too.

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:30.190
Of course, I can't expect people to know 
common-sense stuff about vampires.

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:32.690
Common-sense stuff about vampires?

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:36.480
Like, when you suck someone's blood,

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:39.460
it means you're pledging your love for them.

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:41.370
It's like a kiss.

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:46.500
Like, in a wedding, you suck your 
partner's blood instead of kissing.

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:48.910
Oh, really?

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:51.220
Okay, enough of that.

00:10:51.220 --> 00:10:53.920
I'm going to have my last shrimp.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:57.600
<i>I want her to suck my blood!</i>

00:10:57.600 --> 00:10:59.540
Thanks for the meal.

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:06.990
I-It's not like I still want more or anything.

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:14.110
S-Seriously, I never said I wanted dessert!

00:11:16.370 --> 00:11:17.820
Cream puffs!

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:19.850
Why are they on my desk?

00:11:19.850 --> 00:11:23.210
You prepared them for me, 
didn't you, Kuromine-kun?

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:24.450
Thanks so much!

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:26.450
No, it wasn't me...

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:28.200
Thank you!

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:31.920
Hot!

00:11:32.160 --> 00:11:32.920
Tabasco!

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:33.750
Habañeros!

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:35.380
Chili peppers!

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:37.000
Extra-hot?!

00:11:39.110 --> 00:11:42.850
This one's weirdly heavy... 
And some of them are moving!

00:11:43.690 --> 00:11:45.290
Shiragami, your wings!

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:46.420
Watch your wings!

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:48.140
W-Water!

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:50.020
Right, I should...

00:11:54.620 --> 00:11:56.810
You again, Kuromine Asahi?

00:11:56.810 --> 00:11:58.860
What are you doing here so la—

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:07.490
<i>Sh-She saw her!</i>

00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:09.870
A-Aizawa-san...

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:12.250
W-Wings...

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:14.910
<i>I have to do something, or Shiragami will...</i>

00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:23.410
C-Class Rep, this isn't what you think.

00:12:23.410 --> 00:12:26.970
It's, well... It's just not what you think!

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:30.150
Please, forget everything you just saw.

00:12:30.150 --> 00:12:32.600
Kuromine-kun, it's fine. 
It doesn't matter now.

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:34.350
Please, Class Rep!

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:40.610
Shiragami Youko.

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:46.660
Which planet are you from?!

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:55.040
<b>I wonder what this cream puff tastes like...                       Sh-Shiragami, you shouldn't...</b>

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:55.040
<b>Pant...
Pant...</b>

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:59.240
<i>A tiny Class Rep popped out of her!</i>

00:13:00.690 --> 00:13:02.000
Aizawa-san?

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:03.220
It's you, isn't it?

00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:04.800
D-Don't move!

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:06.470
Don't you see this gun?

00:13:07.610 --> 00:13:08.970
What's this? An antenna?

00:13:09.270 --> 00:13:10.770
It's so cute!

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:11.640
Don't touch it!

00:13:12.340 --> 00:13:14.850
This planet is a theater of our operation.

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:17.060
State your affiliation and planet of origin!

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:20.050
You are an alien, too, are you not?

00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:22.750
No, I'm a vampire.

00:13:22.750 --> 00:13:25.360
Shiragami! You just told her!

00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:28.930
Vampire?

00:13:29.400 --> 00:13:33.250
Wait, Class Rep, you were talking 
about planets and aliens just now.

00:13:33.650 --> 00:13:35.000
Are you actually an alien?

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:43.160
What's up with this surreal scene?

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:45.880
A depressed vampire and alien...

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:45.880
<b>Vampire</b>

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:45.880
<b>Alien</b>

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:48.590
How could I? How could 
I reveal my true identity?

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:49.930
I'm so stupid!

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:51.470
Why did I just give it away?

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:56.270
So you're an alien, right, Class Rep?

00:13:57.280 --> 00:14:00.260
Wh-Whatever are you talking about?

00:14:00.260 --> 00:14:03.530
Yeah, nothing you say will convince 
me when you look like that.

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:06.780
Very well.

00:14:07.690 --> 00:14:09.530
This is my secret.

00:14:10.100 --> 00:14:15.490
I, Aizawa Nagisa, am actually an alien.

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:23.750
And I am an External Unit.

00:14:24.260 --> 00:14:26.380
External Unit?

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:28.560
Is that like a robot?

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:29.010
Yes.

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:32.930
I'm currently conducting an undercover 
investigation of this planet.

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:35.640
Speaking of which, while 
I was on duty yesterday,

00:14:36.290 --> 00:14:38.740
I saw you two walking home together.

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:41.970
Remain calm.

00:14:41.970 --> 00:14:45.150
I am not so foolish as to 
reveal another's secrets.

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:46.660
Really?

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:50.350
You were just spilling all 
your own secrets, though.

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:53.960
I'll keep your secret,

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:55.740
but will you be okay, Aizawa-san?

00:14:56.230 --> 00:14:57.460
Not to worry.

00:14:57.460 --> 00:15:01.170
I have been commanded not to 
reveal myself to the humans,

00:15:01.860 --> 00:15:04.340
but I was never told not to 
reveal myself to vampires.

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:05.840
You're splitting hairs.

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:08.310
On that note, Kuromine Asahi,

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:10.220
I must make a request to you, human.

00:15:11.620 --> 00:15:15.220
I regret that I will have to 
remove some of your memories.

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:19.310
Not to worry. It is only your 
memories regarding my secret.

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:21.410
You can do that?

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:24.650
I apologize, but you wear 
your emotions on your sleeve.

00:15:24.930 --> 00:15:26.580
You cannot keep a secret.

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:31.360
Hey, relax, it'll be over in a second.

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:33.580
I'll wipe everything out just like that.

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:36.830
You're trying to erase something more 
precious than my memory, aren't you?!

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:40.620
Why did you dodge?

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:43.380
That's just a hammer!

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:47.280
Do not worry.

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:50.820
This is a cutting-edge hamm— Memory 
Erasure Apparatus created on my planet.

00:15:50.820 --> 00:15:53.520
I heard that slip of the tongue!

00:15:53.520 --> 00:15:55.140
U-Um...

00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:59.670
Of course. Shiragami Youko,

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:02.170
is it not a problem for your 
identity to be discovered, as well?

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:05.560
Well, yeah, but...

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:07.150
How about this?

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:08.890
If you so desire,

00:16:08.890 --> 00:16:13.680
I can also remove knowledge of your 
secret from Kuromine Asahi's memories.

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:18.030
I would like your opinion 
as well, Kuromine Asahi.

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:23.060
I was careless!

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:25.710
How could I so easily allow 
my target to escape me?

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:27.710
Hey, Aizawa-san!

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:31.480
Wait, Kuromine Asahi!

00:16:31.480 --> 00:16:32.470
No running in the halls!

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:34.840
You're totally running, too!

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:36.660
Just trust me!

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:41.350
The manga on this planet show that a strong 
impact to the head can remove memories!

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:44.250
You're just making it even 
harder for me to trust you!

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:45.890
Please, listen to me!

00:16:45.890 --> 00:16:49.900
If word of this gets out, 
I will be court-martialed,

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:52.840
and then, to set an example, I will receive...

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:56.580
a public spanking!

00:16:57.470 --> 00:16:58.060
No way!

00:16:58.060 --> 00:16:59.490
No way, Class Rep!

00:16:59.760 --> 00:17:01.390
Yeah, that's embarrassing,

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:06.340
but why do I have to get hit with a 
hammer so that you won't get spanked?

00:17:06.340 --> 00:17:08.780
But I'm seventeen this year!

00:17:08.780 --> 00:17:10.140
I'm seventeen!

00:17:10.140 --> 00:17:11.630
Not my problem!

00:17:11.890 --> 00:17:13.630
Then don't mind me.

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:15.970
We still have not settled 
Shiragami Youko's situation!

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:16.550
Shiragami?

00:17:16.980 --> 00:17:18.430
You can't keep a secret.

00:17:19.730 --> 00:17:23.060
But with this... With this 
Memory Erasure Apparatus,

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:26.890
I can erase your memory of her!

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:31.320
Really?

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:34.430
No, wait! Time out!

00:17:34.430 --> 00:17:35.820
Let me think about it.

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:39.820
<i>You truly are easy to read.</i>

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:44.240
<i>You really do like Shiragami Youko.</i>

00:17:44.690 --> 00:17:49.830
<i>And more than that, you desire 
to keep Shiragami Youko's secret.</i>

00:17:51.060 --> 00:17:56.570
Uh, Class Rep, would that erase 
everything about Shiragami Youko?

00:17:57.140 --> 00:17:59.740
Or just everything about her secret?

00:17:59.740 --> 00:18:03.420
Yeah, just everything about her secret.

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:08.230
That might give Shiragami peace of mind.

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:11.670
Try it, Class Rep.

00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:16.150
To be honest, I'm a little—
rather, I'm <i>really</i> scared.

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:18.700
Please, make it as painless as possible!

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:24.290
And if you can do it in one go, 
erase your secret, too.

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:28.190
Thank you.

00:18:28.660 --> 00:18:30.040
And I'm sorry.

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:34.750
I promise to erase only those 
memories about our secrets.

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:48.020
No!

00:18:52.470 --> 00:18:53.460
Shiragami...

00:18:53.460 --> 00:18:54.560
Why?

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:58.430
Wait, this positioning is really bad!

00:18:58.430 --> 00:18:59.860
Kuromine-kun, you idiot!

00:19:01.990 --> 00:19:06.370
I told you, I don't mind 
if you know my secret.

00:19:07.170 --> 00:19:12.130
I really should have had to quit school 
the moment you found out my secret.

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:17.480
I told you that you don't have to try 
so hard to help protect my secret.

00:19:17.480 --> 00:19:19.260
Yet you try so hard,

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:23.630
and you even try to get yourself 
hurt to forget my secret.

00:19:23.630 --> 00:19:26.760
I don't want to go that far
just to protect my secret.

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:32.650
More than that, you need to realize 
how grateful I am, you idiot!

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:36.840
Um, ah... I...

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:39.360
Sorry, Shiragami.

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:42.820
No, I didn't mean for you to do that.

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:44.670
I'm sorry, too.

00:19:44.670 --> 00:19:47.620
No, I'm really sorry, too.

00:19:48.130 --> 00:19:51.040
No, really, I'm sorry.

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:52.670
I'm defeated.

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:57.280
Kuromine Asahi, let's pretend this matter 
about your memories never happened.

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:03.730
I'll try trusting you a little, as well.

00:20:07.630 --> 00:20:08.680
Class Rep...

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:19.360
<i>Wait, defeated? By what?</i>

00:20:19.740 --> 00:20:21.490
<i>By how big that was of Shiragami Youko.</i>

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:23.680
<i>Yes, how big of her.</i>

00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:25.940
<i>This is not a frivolous emotion.</i>

00:20:25.940 --> 00:20:29.370
<i>Besides, Kuromine Asahi's feelings 
for Shiragami Youko are...</i>

00:20:30.520 --> 00:20:34.720
<i>And in all likelihood, Shiragami Youko's 
feelings for Kuromine Asahi are also...</i>

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:36.630
Man, what a relief.

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:39.910
Hey, I know all about it.

00:20:39.910 --> 00:20:41.130
About what?

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:44.800
You used to like Aizawa-san, didn't you?

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:46.750
There were rumors about it last year.

00:20:46.750 --> 00:20:47.800
I'm rooting for you.

00:20:48.310 --> 00:20:49.740
I think you have a chance.

00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:52.810
Believe it or not, I'm pretty 
sensitive about relationship stuff.

00:20:52.810 --> 00:20:55.200
In what way are you sensitive, Shiragami?

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:56.940
And which one of us is the idiot?

00:20:56.940 --> 00:20:58.620
What? Why?

00:20:58.620 --> 00:21:00.190
I'm not an idiot.

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:01.890
No, you are an idiot.

00:21:01.890 --> 00:21:03.070
You are a complete idiot.

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:05.070
What? Me? An idiot?

00:21:06.350 --> 00:21:08.950
What? What did I do wrong?

00:21:09.940 --> 00:21:12.380
Never mind her being a vampire,

00:21:12.380 --> 00:21:15.950
is there any way to fix how dense she is?

00:21:18.740 --> 00:21:22.080
<i>I see, so the feeling isn't exactly mutual.</i>

00:21:23.330 --> 00:21:24.130
<i>But...</i>

00:21:25.390 --> 00:21:28.240
<i>It seems I will become good 
friends with these two.</i>

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:30.260
Tell me, what did I do wrong?

00:21:30.960 --> 00:21:34.320
Please? Come on, Kuromine-kun!

00:23:11.070 --> 00:23:13.530
I hope I got a good story.

00:23:14.150 --> 00:23:19.410
Just you wait, my cute Asahi-chan.

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:24.380
<b>Actually I Am Quiz!</b>

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:24.380
<b>Can you guess?</b>

00:23:21.650 --> 00:23:23.070
Time for the <i>Actually I Am</i> Quiz!

00:23:23.070 --> 00:23:24.380
Now you, Class Rep?

00:23:24.380 --> 00:23:26.870
This is from my planet. It is a cutting-edge...

00:23:26.870 --> 00:23:27.890
Basin, right?

00:23:27.890 --> 00:23:28.580
Incorrect.

00:23:28.580 --> 00:23:31.490
Do you know the correct use of this?

00:23:31.490 --> 00:23:32.930
Let's see...

00:23:32.930 --> 00:23:35.840
Oh, I know! It's one of those things 
that fall on people's heads—

00:23:35.840 --> 00:23:38.130
I don't think you even 
see that on TV anymore.

00:23:38.130 --> 00:23:40.300
I give up.

00:23:40.300 --> 00:23:45.750
It is an Emergency-Avoidance Compact Stealth 
Craft for when you need to get away unnoticed.

00:23:41.850 --> 00:23:46.900
<b>Next Episode:
"Beware Childhood Friends!"</b>

00:23:45.750 --> 00:23:47.330
So it's a basin.

00:23:47.330 --> 00:23:47.860
No!

00:23:47.860 --> 00:23:50.990
It's an Emergency-Avoidance 
Compact Stealth Craft!

00:23:47.860 --> 00:23:50.990
<b>Emergency-Avoidance
Compact Stealth Craft</b>
